{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"6b7ed65b2342ad97c77d77c60854ae392f86e9e1c019baf7e2821d8b15ec48e3"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:76f6f340cdee27eecca418a839cb88976dab0d18b7d3cf2b5c483e50e28c0a6a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"The Cliffs of Moher, Powerscourt Waterfall, Giants Causeway, Ring of Kerry, and Dingle Peninsula because they are iconic Irish landmarks and filming locations.","evidence":"[D1:18 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!\n[D27:21 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] Tim: Definitely Star Wars! It's my favorite and never gets old. What about you, do you have any favorite fantasy films?\n[D28:1 | 5:24 pm on 7 January, 2024] Tim: Hey John, long time no talk. On Friday, I got great news - I'm finally in the study abroad program I applied for! Next month, I'm off to Ireland for a semester.","itemId":"urn:uuid:37d369bc-037c-5122-9fa8-7e12fc7ea90d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d68f132c552399b354150ad4d5d9f76bb4171404934db22b118445fdad0bf56a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which Star Wars-related locations would Tim enjoy during his visit to Ireland?","referenceAnswer":"Skellig Michael, Malin Head, Loop Head, Ceann Sibéal, and Brow Head because they are Star Wars filming locations.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d68f132c552399b354150ad4d5d9f76bb4171404934db22b118445fdad0bf56a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}